### Tenancies — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tenantId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f4
@unitId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f6
@propertyId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f5
@tenancyId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f7

### 1. Create a Tenancy (Assign Tenant to Unit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenancies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "unitId": "{{unitId}}",
  "rentAmount": 25000.00,
  "startDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2027-08-31T23:59:59.000Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### 2. Get All Tenancies (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Get Active Tenancies Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies/active

### 4. Filter Tenancies by Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies?propertyId={{propertyId}}

### 5. Filter Tenancies by Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies?tenantId={{tenantId}}

### 6. Filter Tenancies by Unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies?unitId={{unitId}}

### 7. Get Tenancy Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}

### 8. Update Tenancy (e.g. Rent Amount or Dates)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rentAmount": 27000.00
}

### 9. Terminate Tenancy (Vacate Unit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}/terminate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endDate": "2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Delete Tenancy
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}
